urns `this |> transform` if [this] is non-null, and [null] otherwise.\n\nThis method is the complement of the `??` operator and the equivalent of an `Option` type's\n`map` and `flatMap` methods."; annotations = List(); modifiers = Set(); name = "ifNonNull"; typeParameters = List(new TypeParameter { name = "Result"; variance = null }); parameters = Map("transform", new MethodParameter { name = "transform" }) }) }; typeArguments = List() }; properties = Map("default", new Property { location { line = 2068; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2068" }; docComment = "The function used to compute the default value for a listing element given its index."; annotations = List(); modifiers = Set("hidden"); name = "default"; allModifiers = Set("hidden"); allAnnotations = List() }, "length", new Property { location { line = 2071; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2071" }; docComment = "The number of elements in this listing."; annotations = List(); modifiers = Set(); name = "length"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List() }, "isEmpty", new Property { location { line = 2074; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2074" }; docComment = "Tells if this listing is empty, that is, has zero elements."; annotations = List(); modifiers = Set(); name = "isEmpty"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List() }, "isNotEmpty", new Property { location { line = 2078; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2078" }; docComment = "Tells if this listing is not empty, that is, it has at least one element."; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.31.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "isNotEmpty"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.31.0" }) }, "lastIndex", new Property { location { line = 2084; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2084" }; docComment = "The index of the last element in this listing (same as `length - 1`).\n\nReturns `-1` for an empty list."; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "lastIndex"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "isDistinct", new Property { location { line = 2118; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2118" }; docComment = "Tells if this listing has no duplicate elements.\n\nFacts:\n```\nnew Listing { 1; 2; 3 }.isDistinct\n!new Listing { 1; 2; 1 }.isDistinct\n```"; annotations = List(new AlsoKnownAs { names { "isUnique" } }); modifiers = Set(); name = "isDistinct"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new AlsoKnownAs { names { "isUnique" } }) }, "distinct", new Property { location { line = 2138; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2138" }; docComment = "Removes duplicate elements from this listing, preserving the first occurrence.\n\nFacts:\n```\nnew Listing { 1; 2; 3 }.distinct == new Listing { 1; 2; 3 }\nnew Listing { 1; 2; 1 }.distinct == new Listing { 1; 2 }\n```"; annotations = List(new AlsoKnownAs { names { "unique" } }); modifiers = Set(); name = "distinct"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new AlsoKnownAs { names { "unique" } }) }, "first", new Property { location { line = 2150; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2150" }; docComment = "The first element in this listing.\n\nThrows if this listing is empty.\n\nFacts:\n```\nnew Listing { 1 ; 2 ; 3 }.first == 1\nimport(\"pkl:test\").catch(() -> new Listing {}.first)\n```"; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "first"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "firstOrNull", new Property { location { line = 2154; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2154" }; docComment = "Same as [first] but returns [null] if this listing is empty."; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "firstOrNull"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "last", new Property { location { line = 2166; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2166" }; docComment = "The last element in this listing.\n\nThrows if this listing is empty.\n\nFacts:\n```\nnew Listing { 1 ; 2 ; 3 }.last == 3\nimport(\"pkl:test\").catch(() -> new Listing {}.last)\n```"; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "last"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "lastOrNull", new Property { location { line = 2170; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2170" }; docComment = "Same as [last] but returns [null] if this listing is empty."; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "lastOrNull"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "single", new Property { location { line = 2183; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2183" }; docComment = "The single element in this listing.\n\nThrows if this listing does not have exactly one element.\n\nFacts:\n```\nnew Listing { 1 }.single == 1\nimport(\"pkl:test\").catch(() -> new Listing {}.single)\nimport(\"pkl:test\").catch(() -> new Listing { 1 ; 2 ; 3 }.single)\n```"; annotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }); modifiers = Set(); name = "single"; allModifiers = Set(); allAnnotations = List(new Since { version = "0.27.0" }) }, "singleOrNull", new Property { location { line = 2187; column = 3; displayUri = "https://github.com/apple/pkl/blob/0.32.0/stdlib/base.pkl#L2187" }; docComment = "Same as [single] but returns [null] if this collec